      "content": "the \"letting the weight go\" part... i dont know. it feels less like just relaxing and more like there is no reason to keep pushing through the struggle. if it's all just a meaningless loop, why do we have to keep performing it? it feels like we're just being forced to endure something for no reason at all.",
